graph TD
    Start([Action Received: Slide/Rotate/Close]) --> TentativeMove[Tentative Move Applied in Memory]
    TentativeMove --> BakeMesh[Instantly Bake New Snare Mesh Geometry]
    BakeMesh --> CheckCollision{IsSnareOverlappingBlocker?}
    
    CheckCollision -->|Native Physics Sphere Overlap| IsPolyp{Hit Polyp Collider?}
    CheckCollision -->|Vertex-Sampling Fallback| IsColon{Hit Colon Mesh?}
    
    IsPolyp -->|Overlap Detected| Blocked[Revert Move & Flag Frame as Blocked]
    IsColon -->|Overlap Detected| Blocked
    
    IsPolyp -->|No Overlap| ValidMove[Commit Move]
    IsColon -->|No Overlap| ValidMove
    
    Blocked --> End([Wait for Next Physics Step])
    ValidMove --> End
